@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix tgt: <http://example.org/tgt#> .

tgt:Work a owl:Class .
tgt:Agent a owl:Class .
tgt:title a owl:DatatypeProperty .
tgt:status a owl:DatatypeProperty .
tgt:year a owl:DatatypeProperty .
tgt:name a owl:DatatypeProperty .
tgt:shelf a owl:DatatypeProperty .
tgt:medium a owl:ObjectProperty .
tgt:genre a owl:ObjectProperty .
tgt:creator a owl:ObjectProperty .
